  <worksheets>
    <worksheet name='蒙东地理数据多边形图'>
      <layout-options>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='ui-sans-serif' fontsize='8'>个人学习笔记:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='ui-sans-serif' fontsize='8'>1.经纬度需要在分析中取消聚合度量</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='ui-sans-serif' fontsize='8'>2.电脑只会按“顺序”字段中里坐标的先后顺序连线画图，如果没有“顺序”这个字段作为路径，多边形图将会错乱。</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='ui-sans-serif' fontsize='8'>3.市名通过右键对应的四边形区域，选择添加注释--选择区域--输入市名来实现。</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='示例数据 (蒙东地理数据)' name='federated.13s0iu21i0ez2o1djbtgh0pqgbn8' />
          </datasources>
          <mapsources>
            <mapsource name='Tableau' />
          </mapsources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.13s0iu21i0ez2o1djbtgh0pqgbn8'>
            <column aggregation='Avg' datatype='real' name='[Latitude]' role='measure' semantic-role='[Geographical].[Latitude]' type='quantitative' />
            <column aggregation='Avg' datatype='real' name='[Longitude]' role='measure' semantic-role='[Geographical].[Longitude]' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[Latitude]' derivation='Avg' name='[avg:Latitude:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[Longitude]' derivation='Avg' name='[avg:Longitude:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column-instance column='[地市]' derivation='None' name='[none:地市:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[顺序]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:顺序:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column datatype='string' name='[地市]' role='dimension' type='nominal' />
            <column datatype='integer' name='[顺序]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='false' />
        </view>
